 == Release Notes
 :sectnums!:
 
+=== Version 1.1.1
+
+Fixed errata:
+
+* Fix repeated transfer when `hazard3_apb_async_bridge` is connected to a standard APB Requester.
+** This behaviour did not affect instantiation inside of `hazard3_jtag_dtm`.
